Keep a shared used as an empty list of whole numbers.
Keep a shared parts as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared answers as an empty list of text.
To permute from depth (a whole number).
If depth is 3, let built be join parts with "", append built to answers, then return.
For every position from 0 to 2.
